        "precision": "day",
        "until_approx": "four in the morning"
      },
      "kind": "state",
      "place": "ministry-palace",
      "text": "At the ball Mathilde was prettier than all, gracious and crazy with joy; all the men asked her name, the attaches wanted to waltz with her, and the Minister remarked her.",
      "who": [
        {
          "id": "mathilde",
          "role": "agent"
        },
        {
          "id": "minister",
          "role": "witness"
        }
      ],
