        "seq": 8,
        "approx": "four in the morning"
      },
      "kind": "depart",
      "place": "ministry-palace",
      "text": "At about four in the morning Mathilde left; Loisel threw modest wraps over her shoulders and she, ashamed before the furs, hurried down the stairs; they found no carriage in the street.",
      "who": [
        {
          "id": "mathilde",
          "role": "agent"
        },
        {
          "id": "loisel",
          "role": "agent"
