      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "e09",
      "when": {
        "seq": 9
      },
      "kind": "depart",
      "place": "streets-quay",
      "text": "They went down toward the Seine, shivering, found on the quay an ancient night coupé that took them to their door in the Rue des Martyrs; Loisel reflected he must be at the Ministry at ten.",
