        "P71",
        "P72",
        "P73",
        "P74",
        "P75",
        "P76",
        "P77"
      ],
      "says": "You're sure you had it on when you left the ball? ... Yes, I felt it in the vestibule of the palace. ... It must be in the cab. Did you take his number?"
    },
    {
