        "after": [
          "e11"
        ],
        "gap": "P1D"
      },
      "kind": "act",
      "place": "police-etc",
      "text": "Mathilde waited in her ball dress all day in mad fear; Loisel returned about seven with nothing, went to Police Headquarters, the newspaper offices (offering a reward) and the cab companies, and came back that night pale and empty-handed.",
      "who": [
        {
          "id": "loisel",
          "role": "agent"
        },
