      "when": {
        "seq": 21
      },
      "kind": "thought",
      "place": "garret",
      "text": "Mme. Loisel looked old, strong and hard and rough, with frowsy hair and red hands; sometimes at the window she thought of the evening of the ball and wondered what would have happened had she not lost the necklace.",
