      "kind": "meeting",
      "place": "champs-elysees",
      "text": "One Sunday Mathilde, walking in the Champs Elysées, saw Mme. Forestier, still young and charming, leading a child, and went up to her; Mme. Forestier did not recognise her at first, then cried out at how she was changed.",
